('foreo-bear-3-microcurrent', 'FOREO BEAR 3 Smart Microcurrent Facial Toning Device - Pearl Pink', 'personal-care', 250000, 245000, 215000, 8, 0.18, '/assets/products/foreo-bear-3.jpg', 'A professional facial workout in the palm of your hand. Advanced microcurrent with T-Sonic pulsations tones 69 facial muscles, while the companion app scans your face and creates personalized routines. Anti-shock system scans skin for safe, effective treatment.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 215000, '/assets/products/foreo-bear-3.jpg', 235000, 4.6, 0, 'FOREO', 1, 1),

